# THE WOOD (THE MAZE), SLAB 3 — 56 rooms. Takes the maze to 115.
#
# Two more honest rows (the wood is 7 rows deep now), eight more pockets, two
# more thresholds, and THREE more lying cores of twelve.
#
# NEW STRUCTURE: THE SUNKEN WOOD. Core F sits BELOW the others. You reach it
# only by `down` exits added to four rooms scattered through the older cores —
# the ground gives way where you did not choose it to — and you leave it by two
# `up` exits that put you back on the honest band. So being lost now has a
# second stage: lost, and then lower.
#
# Ring maths, same as slab 2 but m=12: north +1, east +3, south +5, west +7.
# d_n+d_s = 6 and d_e+d_w = 10, neither ≡ 0 mod 12, so no exit retraces.

!region wood

# ---- attachments -----------------------------------------------------------

